==Battleground==
*1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns as the boss after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[I.M. Phace]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[CyberFace]] spawns as the boss after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*3 [[CyberFace]]s spawn after 233.33 seconds<sup>7,000f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Having [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] makes this stage way easier. Bring Fishman, [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]], a Critter (preferably a unit with guaranteed or consistent critical hits, such as [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Hurricat]] or [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Waitress Cat]]), general attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]], along with Crowd Controllers like [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Monk Cat]] and [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Necromancer Cat]]. Get money and wait until the Shy Boy approaches the base and kill it rapidly. The I.M Phace should be near the base by now so send out Fishman and your attackers to kill it off swiftly. Wait until the Cyberface comes out to send out your critter and hope you get lucky enough to kill the Cyberface. If you successfully take down the Cyberface, send out Awakened Bahamut to deal massive damage to the Face and kill it before the wave of Cyberfaces come out and slaughter you. This stage is fast paced, so you have to act quick as well.

